        "voice": "arthur",
        "text": "Hello, and welcome back to Safe Online! I am Ryan. Is your computer slow? Does it freeze? Do not worry. Today I have three easy fixes. Fix number one: restart your computer. Many problems stop after a restart. Fix number two: check your Wi-Fi. If the internet is slow, turn the router off and on again. Fix number three: look at the error message. Write it down, and look for it online. And if your computer does not turn on, check the battery and the charger. If it is still broken, call a technician. See you next Monday!"
